{"title":"Career Roadmap: Urban Analyst","role":"Urban Analyst","summary":"An Urban Analyst uses urban planning knowledge, GIS, statistics, spatial data, visualization, and analytical tools to understand how cities function and support evidence-based planning decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Plan (Bachelor of Planning)","Course":"Landscape / Transport / Infrastructure Planning"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Urban Analyst uses urban planning knowledge, GIS, statistics, spatial data, visualization, and analytical tools to understand how cities function and support evidence-based planning decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"The role is more data-oriented than a conventional planning role. An Urban Analyst may analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Urban growth"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Housing"},{"text":"Public facilities"},{"text":"Green spaces"},{"text":"Environmental conditions"},{"text":"Real-estate development"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Urban services"},{"text":"Climate risks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","GIS","Spatial Analytics","Statistics","Python","Urban Planning"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"GIS, statistics, urban datasets, spatial analysis, planning fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Urban Analyst / GIS Analyst / Urban Data Analyst / Planning Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Urban Analyst / Urban Analytics Specialist / Spatial Planning Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Urban Analytics Director / Urban Intelligence Lead / City Strategy Consultant"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Future opportunities will increasingly connect urban analytics with:"},{"typ